#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/flir-lepton.rst:4
msgid ""
"The FLIR Lepton Adapter Module connects FLIR Lepton thermal cores (sold "
"separately) to the OpenMV Cam, with both AGC and direct-thermal modes for "
"human / object temperature measurement."
